{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 22, :comments ["<b>Until we cross your border.</b> They were not asking to pass through his land but to skirt his border from the outside, as they skirted the land of Edom and the land of Moab. And so it is written in the parashah אלה הדברים: כאשר עשו לי בני עשו היושבים בשעיר והמואבים היושבים בער — that they let them skirt their land and their border."], :book :numbers, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 21, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:09:48.120446200Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}